  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "George Coats, first Baron Glentanar, was a Scottish businessman from the Paisley thread-manufacturing family. His father, Thomas, brought him into the business as a commercial clerk before appointing him a director. Coats developed extensive financial interests beyond the family firm and entered the peerage in 1916, two years before his death.",
